F (\u221a2/2, -\u221a2/2 +1) \u2248 (0.707, 0.293)\n\nG (-\u221a2/2, \u221a2/2 +1) \u2248 (-0.707, 1.707)\n\nH (-\u221a2/2, -1 + \u221a2/2) \u2248 (-0.707, -0.293)\n\nNow, compute area of EFGH using shoelace formula.\n\nOrder of points: E, F, G, H.\n\nCoordinates:\n\nE: (\u221a2/2, - (\u221a2/2 +1 ))\n\nF: (\u221a2/2, -\u221a2/2 +1 )\n\nG: (-\u221a2/2, \u221a2/2 +1 )\n\nH: (-\u221a2/2, -1 + \u221a2/2 )\n\nShoelace formula:\n\nSum over edges:\n\nx_E * y_F = (\u221a2/2) * (-\u221a2/2 +1 ) = (\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 )\n\nx_F * y_G = (\u221a2/2) * (\u221a2/2 +1 ) = (\u221a2/2)(1 + \u221a2/2 )\n\nx_G * y_H = (-\u221a2/2) * (-1 + \u221a2/2 ) = (\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 )\n\nx_H * y_E = (-\u221a2/2) * (-\u221a2/2 -1 ) = (\u221a2/2)(\u221a2/2 +1 )\n\nSum of these terms:\n\n(\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 ) + (\u221a2/2)(1 + \u221a2/2 ) + (\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 ) + (\u221a2/2)(\u221a2/2 +1 )\n\nLet's compute each term:\n\nFirst term: (\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 )\n\nSecond term: (\u221a2/2)(1 + \u221a2/2 )\n\nThird term: same as first term\n\nFourth term: same as second term\n\nSo total sum = 2*(first term + second term) = 2*[ (\u221a2/2)(1 - \u221a2/2 +1 + \u221a2/2 ) ] = 2*[ (\u221a2/2)(2) ] = 2*(\u221a2) = 2\u221a2\n\nSimilarly, sum the other diagonal terms:\n\ny_E * x_F = (-\u221a2/2 -1 )*(\u221a2/2 )\n\ny_F * x_G = (-\u221a2/2 +1 )*(-\u221a2/2 )\n\ny_G * x_H = (\u221a2/2 +1 )*(-\u221a2/2 )\n\ny_H * x_E = (-1 + \u221a2/2 )*(\u221a2/2 )\n\nCompute each term:\n\nFirst term: (-\u221a2/2 -1 )*(\u221a2/2 ) = - ( (\u221a2/2)(\u221a2/2) + (1)(\u221a2/2 ) ) = - ( (0.5 + \u221a2/2 ) )\n\nSecond term: (-\u221a2/2 +1 )*(-\u221a2/2 ) = (\u221a2/2 -1 )*(\u221a2/2 ) = ( (\u221a2/2 )^2 - \u221a2/2 ) = (0.5 - \u221a2/2 )\n\nThird term: (\u221a2/2 +1 )*(-\u221a2/2 ) = - ( (\u221a2/2 )^2 + \u221a2/2 ) = - (0.5 + \u221a2/2 )\n\nFourth term: (-1 + \u221a2/2 )*(\u221a2/2 ) = -\u221a2/2 + (\u221a2/2 )^2 = -\u221a2/2 + 0.5\n\nSum these terms:\n\nFirst term: -0.5 - \u221a2/2\n\nSecond term: 0.5 - \